# basePath Chapter5

::FirstContractOpenCh5 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
//todo need a bridge between end of comic with keela not picking up the phone. 

{@PAL}      	Captain, I have a surprise for you.  
{@Player}   	Wait... did Keela call me back?
{@PAL}      	No. 
{@Player}   	Oh.
{@PAL}      	Instead of one contract, you now have... two!
{@PAL}      	Congratulations on achieving agency Captain! 
{@Player}   	...thanks P.A.L. 
{@PAL}			One of them is a little more complicated. You can switch back to the other one if you decide its too hard. 

//EDIT - KACY 
// Changed PAL's ID to match with Unity Display. 
::BeforeSupplyChainCh5
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey Cap', we're hauling farther out this time.
{@Player}   How much farther?
{@Quinn}    Far enough that some of these routes cut through pirate territory.
{@Player}   Velos?
{@Quinn}    Yep. Callie's neighborhood.
{@Quinn}	Callie's been taunting ol'Ovill over in Forsch. I think he's going to have to get on blood pressure meds soon. 
{@Player}	Are your haulers on good terms with her? 
{@Quinn}   Well, she is a pirate. You never know.
{@Quinn}    Just watch where you draw your routes.

